{"seq":1,"slug":"poetry-and-ci","title":"Poetry And Ci","docCount":2,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/su-shi/major-works/poetry-and-ci","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"the-red-cliff-rhapsodies","title":"赤壁赋","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/su-shi/major-works/poetry-and-ci/the-red-cliff-rhapsodies","wordCount":1793,"readingTime":8},{"seq":2,"slug":"famous-ci-poems","title":"千古名词","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/su-shi/major-works/poetry-and-ci/famous-ci-poems","wordCount":1766,"readingTime":8}],"introHtml":"<p>本章考察苏轼的诗词名篇。《赤壁赋》（前、后），是苏轼被贬黄州时写下的千古名赋，将写景、抒情、说理完美交融，以旷达的哲思抒发了对宇宙人生的深刻体悟。他的词更是宋词的巅峰——《念奴娇·赤壁怀古》（豪放）、《水调歌头·明月几时有》（旷达）、《江城子》（悼亡深情），风格多样、意境深远。本章揭示苏轼诗词的不朽成就。</p>\n"}